#: ../../installation.rst:2 3ec56ef342774886bb454b25ac78f3e4
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "설치"

#: ../../installation.rst:4 34217bb506854dffa12286c51fed41a1
msgid "There are two ways to install **tabby-keepass-ssh**."
msgstr "**tabby-keepass-ssh**\\ 를 설치하는 방법은 두 가지입니다."

#: ../../installation.rst:7 1d231887c88f442bb2f0035e25b6e01e
msgid "Method 1 — Install from the Tabby Plugin Manager"
msgstr "방법 1 — Tabby 플러그인 매니저에서 설치"

#: ../../installation.rst:9 7a1359634d9b46c48e713c3f6a9d33c7
msgid "This is the recommended method for most users."
msgstr "대부분의 사용자에게 권장되는 방법입니다."

#: ../../installation.rst:11 14d7dd3b364842d79802756aba234ea4
msgid "Open Tabby and go to **Settings → Plugins**."
msgstr "Tabby를 열고 **설정(Settings) → 플러그인(Plugins)**\\ 으로 이동합니다."

#: ../../installation.rst:12 56630c64df304a68930daaf196719c67
msgid "In the search box, type ``keepass-ssh``."
msgstr "검색창에 ``keepass-ssh``\\ 를 입력합니다."

#: ../../installation.rst:13 0be96fba97e5478c8612a084526d1110
msgid "Click **Install**, then restart Tabby when prompted."
msgstr "**설치(Install)**\\ 를 클릭한 다음, 안내에 따라 Tabby를 재시작합니다."

#: ../../installation.rst:16 eccf6c058d4e4f20b828d40178db40f1
msgid "Method 2 — Clone the Git repository and build from source"
msgstr "방법 2 — Git 저장소를 복제하여 직접 설치"

#: ../../installation.rst:18 db55dd4abd5847b0b02ab5d019d98151
msgid ""
"Use this method if you want to build the plugin yourself, run a "
"development build, or contribute changes."
msgstr "플러그인을 직접 빌드하거나, 개발용 빌드를 실행하거나, 코드 기여를 하고 싶다면 이 방법을 사용하세요."

#: ../../installation.rst:21 7b6373b408d04df591ecd4011144233a
msgid "**Requirements:** `Node.js <https://nodejs.org/>`_ 18 or later."
msgstr "**요구 사항:** `Node.js <https://nodejs.org/>`_ 18 이상."

#: ../../installation.rst:31 9fbc336581404de2917afddce9aa137d
msgid ""
"``npm run install-plugin`` copies the built files to the correct Tabby "
"plugin directory for your operating system:"
msgstr "``npm run install-plugin``\\ 은 빌드된 파일을 운영체제에 맞는 Tabby 플러그인 디렉터리로 복사합니다:"

#: ../../installation.rst:37 a001fbac7e804d2b915a0b79ffffbdaf
msgid "OS"
msgstr "OS"

#: ../../installation.rst:38 dda9b3d2df5f4e7da6cb6011df72c0d2
msgid "Plugin directory"
msgstr "플러그인 디렉터리"

#: ../../installation.rst:39 065abdee35ed4177bdae8fdce14a3cea
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: ../../installation.rst:40 a4bab70e70a3433a8ae470c3fba29e2b
msgid ""
"``~/Library/Application Support/tabby/plugins/node_modules/tabby-keepass-"
"ssh/``"
msgstr ""
"``~/Library/Application Support/tabby/plugins/node_modules/tabby-keepass-"
"ssh/``"

#: ../../installation.rst:41 51197ce1452948e9af7afc6fd5d1d72e
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../installation.rst:42 06f296c88b0445c4974ce13864774086
msgid "``~/.config/tabby/plugins/node_modules/tabby-keepass-ssh/``"
msgstr "``~/.config/tabby/plugins/node_modules/tabby-keepass-ssh/``"

#: ../../installation.rst:43 6549b1d7bcab4da1972ae21c8821a632
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../installation.rst:44 884817a67dda4e58ad6df1f9e0e24b21
msgid "``%APPDATA%\\tabby\\plugins\\node_modules\\tabby-keepass-ssh\\``"
msgstr "``%APPDATA%\\tabby\\plugins\\node_modules\\tabby-keepass-ssh\\``"

#: ../../installation.rst:46 5c580f048ed24246bade9df29f0ba193
msgid "Restart Tabby after installation."
msgstr "설치 후 Tabby를 재시작하세요."

#: ../../installation.rst:48 2a78cb893d6c4777a3d8057f13c1a724
msgid "Once installed, continue to :doc:`usage` to configure the plugin."
msgstr "설치가 끝났다면 플러그인을 설정하기 위해 :doc:`usage` 문서로 이동하세요."

